{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cd6a2d8f70eaf9f7b831ceef9689a54649c654561c82bed05d739ab3b837f35e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e29fc3ff4275eb38a6e8d2cf8bb34df01019ff0661728c5e9f4eae355b0fb4b",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n我刚才也看了那个节目的播出了哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b627ff41369ffdbd07320d7955caeda2587f923ecfb2f80eb80693a1da488b36",
      "text": "虽然为了绝对不错过，家里人提前录好了节目，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9454cb03fba039440f295c55ac29f5d3181de67f0b2766c41095877a2f076abd",
      "text": "但结果大家还是聚在一起看了实时直播！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a87db53da61b6338bd7adf0b9f30431f797440cbd0c6a74af3e9c7200dcf74",
      "text": "因为我有很多关于前辈们的事想聊，所以在录制时滔滔不绝讲了好多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d333686914a7343a84c51947e2b7dcfeb137a55c3ab456beb35f3fb46fe3b36",
      "text": "结果对每个人的介绍都好好播出来了！\n没被剪掉真是太好了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f57fccd3fe3ad369cf72b3a5c3f10a87c1672ee9dd4aeb4fbece4d5976207ae5",
      "text": "这样一来，不管是平时一直支持我们的人，\n还是通过这个节目第一次知道我们的人，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c361066272a78007126a302413b50755fd99222529224652da6ea3d91e1fb9bc",
      "text": "都能感受到High×Joker是一支超级帅气的乐队了吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb6426d59244d7ab412162caa1b5213ae0270a4bbe26337aa612c6e363505fd3",
      "text": "非常精彩的\n谈话！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6571a1654717af13e2cea76339208ecf531062c6643c4b131c3a4fd017e1b1c",
      "text": "好像已经引起\n话题了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7057269bfec199c7ef8c1fc29d606bba489f89f9a025cd9336efa9913d53d47a",
      "text": "对吧！能得到制作人酱这么说，\n超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87a0627532dd63e629f301332dbb1145ff20eeb180803d57f4c2b1bb50bfad4b",
      "text": "真的假的！？我搞不好……\n难道其实很有做介绍的天赋……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8ea94a5a672af62abad19c9d8e6eb17124bf20319a5415971777b70004395b0",
      "text": "对了！要是下次还有带访谈环节的\n工作找上门，我想挑战的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0c7673186b9edbcc4e30ffdd95b5623e9d5eb35798c3f9f65ce132c33c15be6",
      "text": "哇不行不行！想说的事情太多了根本停不下来，后面的明天当面聊吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:024shk_402_2_4_024_02_09_a:2_4_024_02_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bc736d3e9f44e68428fe68ccf22145b576c40f50a4ce186d6e0d4fe40169375",
      "text": "今后也要好好期待我的活跃表现哦！\n晚安啦，制作人酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
